Logic :

compare least significant bit of 2 numbers , if it not equal , then increment answer by 1
after comparison , 
do right shift operation one time on both the numbers 

repeat this until the maximum number become zero


Code :

class Solution {
    public int hammingDistance(int x, int y) {
        int max=Math.max(x,y);
        int min=Math.min(x,y);
        int ans=0;
        while(max!=0){
            if((max&1)!=(min&1))
            ans++;
            max=max>>1;
            min=min>>1; 
        }
        return ans;
    }
}
